### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@railnexus.com",
  "password": "Test@12345",
  "phone": "9876543210"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@railnexus.com",
  "password": "Test@12345"
}



### Login - Wrong Password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@railnexus.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword123"
}

### Login - Successful
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@railnexus.com",
  "password": "Test@12345"
}

### Get current user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0QHJhaWxuZXh1cy5jb20iLCJyb2xlIjoiVVNFUiIsImlhdCI6MTc4NzU2MDQ1MiwiZXhwIjoxNzg3NjQ2ODUyfQ.WctJgWM5-etExfGFEoiq690-XyY1D9OLylplbz3FSG2qpwbn40xRNwYbT_D34fwE


